    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Driving can be monotonous. It can be lonely. It can be boring. And, if you’re a new or inexperienced driver, this boredom can make driving dangerous. That’s where Wheels N’ Deals comes in. Wheels N’ Deals is an interactive and immersive interface that gamifies driving. Wheels N’ Deals is an unobtrusive interface that makes driving safer, more fun, and more social. And, on top of all of this, people who play Wheels N’ Deals earn points towards real-world deals and rewards—like lower insurance rates, gas cards, or even a new car.",
